      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QVNrvgG_7YJAdyau-tRsDW9-mDc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255245-award-winning-white-chicken-chili-DDMFS-step-3-1-4f43bd0822394c92ad074db8d58e4084.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255245/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 8 to 10 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JHMZwWa3h5_6OjN1lpDBYlOefwM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255245-award-winning-white-chicken-chili-DDMFS-step-3-144fdf7a86284dbfb5816fa12dd8f315.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255245/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken to a cutting board. Shred with two forks or cut into bite-sized pieces. Return to the slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
